    "summary": "A daily (and by-hand) prune of the `native-store` pre-release. `ci/native/prune.py` always keeps the references' and releases' keys. It also keeps the last 20 trees of `native/` on `main`, and every other key for 14 days. It deletes the rest, then deletes the oldest assets it doesn't keep forever while the store is over 1 GB. `store.sh` now labels each upload with where the key was first built (`main <sha>`, `pr <n> <sha>`, `release <sha>`, `dispatch <sha>`).",
